{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend fire, water, earth and air in chaotic online combat and co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements Divided lets you become a peak elemental warrior, moving your hands to summon attacks and defenses, levelling up your character, and using your powers to hurl yourself across arenas. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the elements, each with their own playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 60 attacks and abilities across four core elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast fireballs, control the flow of water, summon air shields, build earthly barriers and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand-off in thrilling online modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test in PvP or team up with friends to take on scores of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your ranks in each element to earn new skills and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter to your liking with a huge range of personalization options<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805770/extras/de76a1cb98d295c6be60b1ab12ad7975.poster.avif?t=1755578364\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805770/extras/de76a1cb98d295c6be60b1ab12ad7975.webm?t=1755578364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step to Greatness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2805770/2411be7bd74b8a5b46b0313646f67d84a4a5361c.jpg"},{"name":"First Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2805770/af5124a25a0f90c841c08e8d79dcdb30ed556085.jpg"},{"n